OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to build houses on aerodrome
OL,4,Asite split residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Surrey residents are divided over
OL,7,Fproposals to earmark the Redhill
OL,8,FAerodrome for thousands of new homes in
OL,9,Fa council's draft local plan.
OL,11,FTandridge District Council (TDC) ran a
OL,12,Fconsultation on its plan over the
OL,13,Fsummer, which listed the site as a
OL,14,Fpossible "strategic development"
OL,15,Flocation, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,16,FService said.
OL,18,FTDC's consultation found that 53% of
OL,19,Frespondents expressed support, while
OL,20,F47% opposed the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
